        rdfs:label "has Content Warning"@en ;
        rdfs:comment "If the card marked by Wizards of the Coast (opens new window) for having sensitive content. See this official article (opens new window) for more information.. 0: doesn't have 1: has sensitve content or Wizards of the Coast commonsense evidence: Cards with this property may have missing or degraded properties and values."@en ] ;
